    "preamble": "Polisetty Radha vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 24 July, 2020 Author: M.Ganga Rao Bench: M.Ganga Rao The Hon'Ble Sri Justice M.Ganga Rao Criminal Petition No.2813 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "3. Case of the prosecution is that on the ground that the accused were transporting gutka packets in the aforementioned vehicle on 26.5.2020, at about 8:30 hours, at the border check post, T Junction, on Macharla and Hyderabad National Highway in Nagarjunasagar Police limits, Macharla Mandal, respondent No.2 police registered a case in Crime No.97 of 2020 for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 273, 420 and 328 read with 34 I.P.C. and Sections 57(1), 58 and 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
